# 4. ORGANIZER PERFORMANCE
# Groups organizers and counts their registrations.
# Source table: organisers
#
# This version intentionally reports organizer registrations.
# It does not claim to calculate ticket sales or revenue because
# those measures require verified relationships across tables.
# ============================================================
